menu "MCP9601 simulator"

config MCP9601_SIMULATOR_OLED
    bool "Enable optional SSD1306 OLED display"
    default y
    help
        Show the simulated MCP9601 temperature on a 128x32 SSD1306 OLED at
        address 0x3C. The OLED uses the independent I2C controller on GPIO 8
        (SDA) and GPIO 9 (SCL). The simulator continues normally when the
        display is enabled but not connected.

endmenu

